  "variation": {
    "seeded": true,
    "notes": "The mist's shape, the souls' paths and the bones change per cast. Drain pulses every 1.5 s, always."
  },
  "director_notes": "The coordinator suggested a necrotic aura alongside Lisa's examples. Dark things can't be additive, so the mist and stain are alpha and the magic (sigil, souls, drain ring) is the additive green accent. Souls orbit the other way from the bones so the aura churns. Loop 1200-4200 ms."
